(7645254, 1242455, 141319, '<td valign="top">Hmmm I just learned something! I always thought weevils had a long "snout", but reading up on Wiki, I see how wrong I was. Thanks for the Entomology lesson :-) ...This was one of my Favs in the challenge, so congratulations. <br/></td>', 'Hmmm I just learned something! I always thought weevils had a long "snout", but reading up on Wiki, I see how wrong I was. Thanks for the Entomology lesson :-) ...This was one of my Favs in the challenge, so congratulations. ', '2019-11-04 02:13:57.000000', NULL, 0),
