(7645835, 1242485, 250302, '<td valign="top">Thank you to everyone for their votes and comments!!  I definitely did not anticipate making the front page, let alone winning with this photo.  It was taken on a dreary/cloudy/misty UK afternoon at the stables just beside my home.  I really struggled with the center post being so prominent (and bright), but hoped with the processing and title the webs would be the focus as intended.</td>', 'Thank you to everyone for their votes and comments!!  I definitely did not anticipate making the front page, let alone winning with this photo.  It was taken on a dreary/cloudy/misty UK afternoon at the stables just beside my home.  I really struggled with the center post being so prominent (and bright), but hoped with the processing and title the webs would be the focus as intended.', '2019-11-08 23:14:34.000000', NULL, 0);
